---
import mark from '../../../resources/brand/mark.svg?raw'

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL
const year = 2026
---

<footer class="foot">
  <div class="foot-inner">
    <div class="foot-brand">
      <span class="foot-mark" set:html={mark} />
      <p>
        대면 회의를 위한 회의록 앱.<br />
        오디오는 기기 안에서만 처리됩니다.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="foot-cols">
      <section>
        <h3>문서</h3>
        <a href={`${base}docs/`}>사용 안내</a>
        <a href={`${base}changelog/`}>변경 이력</a>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h3>저장소</h3>
        <a href="https://github.com/git-artinus/minit">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/git-artinus/minit/releases">릴리즈</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/git-artinus/minit/issues/new/choose">문제 신고</a>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h3>고지</h3>
        <a href="https://github.com/git-artinus/minit/blob/main/LICENSE">라이선스</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/git-artinus/minit/blob/main/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md">
          오픈소스 고지
        </a>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="foot-bar">
    <span>© {year} Artinus</span>
    <span class="foot-built">whisper.cpp · Electron</span>
  </div>
</footer>
